libcacard: libcacard (CAC (Common Access Card) library)
libcacard:
libcacard: This library provides emulation of smart cards to a virtual card
libcacard: reader running in a guest virtual machine. It implements DoD CAC
libcacard: standard with separate pki containers (compatible coolkey), using
libcacard: certificates read from NSS.
libcacard:
libcacard: Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/spice/libcacard
